{"3932990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nun of your Business", "steam_appid": 3932990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 This is &quot;<strong>Nun of Your Business&quot;</strong> 🔥</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-packed battlefield where anime-styled warrior nuns cleanse the world of demonic corruption! 💥👼</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fa1fc7795ff874b083bb8158d6b06e17.poster.avif?t=1761120063\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fa1fc7795ff874b083bb8158d6b06e17.webm?t=1761120063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🙏 Select from a powerful roster of anime-styled nuns.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From a nun to an angelic looking warrior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and master unique holy warriors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the unholy monsters from Hell. <br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/8bc2c50553fa31f2b286e03adc837317.poster.avif?t=1761120063\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/8bc2c50553fa31f2b286e03adc837317.webm?t=1761120063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👹 Battle grotesque demons, skeletal hordes, and corrupted abominations that crawl from the deepest pits of hell.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay waves of twisted monsters born from darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to varied enemy attack patterns and unholy tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purge arenas filled with hellish threats and escalating challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fe3892de75e579d8bbed81e125725ef8.poster.avif?t=1761120063\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fe3892de75e579d8bbed81e125725ef8.webm?t=1761120063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👑 Face off against monstrous bosses in intense encounters that will test your aim, timing, and divine wrath.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in cinematic battles against towering horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and counter deadly boss mechanics and phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash ultimate skills to deliver divine judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When sacred vows meet unholy war... prepare for divine retribution.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 This is &quot;<strong>Nun of Your Business&quot;</strong> 🔥</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-packed battlefield where anime-styled warrior nuns cleanse the world of demonic corruption! 💥👼</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fa